docs {
  # Ingests a custom event

  The ingestion of custom events is subject to licensing (see [licensing documentation](https://www.dynatrace.com/support/help/shortlink/dps-events)).

  **Auth:** OAuth (inherited from collection)

  **Required OAuth scopes:** `openpipeline:events.davis:ingest`, `storage:events:write`, `environment-api:events:write`

  **API token scopes:** events.ingest
}
